    "detailed_description": "Embark on a frog's odyssey in &quot;Jump, Froggy! Jump!&quot; a challenging 3D platformer! In this enchanting world, you'll step into the webbed feet of a courageous frog on his journey to rescue the Princess Frog. <br />\r\nJump your to the top of the castle and save your Froggy Princess!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor casual gamers try Easy mode:<br />\r\n- Pause menu checkpoints<br />\r\n- Quick checkpoint reloading<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor all you competitive gamers try the classic mode:<br />\r\n- No \u201ccheating\u201d<br />\r\n- Saves your best time<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso wear stylish hats by completing each game mode and finding the special hat hidden somewhere around the game world.",
    "about_the_game": "Embark on a frog's odyssey in &quot;Jump, Froggy! Jump!&quot; a challenging 3D platformer! In this enchanting world, you'll step into the webbed feet of a courageous frog on his journey to rescue the Princess Frog. <br />\r\nJump your to the top of the castle and save your Froggy Princess!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor casual gamers try Easy mode:<br />\r\n- Pause menu checkpoints<br />\r\n- Quick checkpoint reloading<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor all you competitive gamers try the classic mode:<br />\r\n- No \u201ccheating\u201d<br />\r\n- Saves your best time<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso wear stylish hats by completing each game mode and finding the special hat hidden somewhere around the game world.",
